  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the hurried march toward San Cha Mountain, narration names her one of the beauties in the clan, young and beautiful, with defensive abilities even clan elders praise. In the group’s battle formation the healing Gu Master is at the rear with defensive Gu Master Tie Xian Hua beside him.",
      "chapters": [
        359
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is young and beautiful, one of the beauties in the clan.",
      "chapters": [
        359
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is petite.",
      "chapters": [
        360
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the formation opens, Tie Dao Ku and Tie Xian Hua move to the front together. She shouts that little beast king is too arrogant, grows an enormous black golden lotus from her palm into umbrella lotus Gu, and charges while the huge lotus covers her petite body as a shield. Fang Yuan sends her flying ten feet; she lands without falling, then is casually sent flying again when she rushes back. Later a thunder boar phantom breaks umbrella lotus Gu and scatters its petals; she throws up huge amounts of blood while Tie Mu holds her and begins healing.",
      "chapters": [
        360
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "interception-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_dao_ku",
        "gu_umbrella_lotus_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tie_mu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Tie Mu heals her, she stands and tells Fang Yuan the outcome is a foregone conclusion, that he is heavily encircled, and that capture may still leave a way out. When he grows bone wings she stares in bewilderment that the intel did not mention a flying type Gu and that it is clearly rank four.",
      "chapters": [
        361
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seven-against-one",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She raises umbrella lotus Gu, shouts that Fang Yuan killed Tie Mu and that she wants him dead, and pounces. Fang Yuan brushes past her with his wings; she stops after five or six steps, then blood pours from her neck and her head is sent flying as she is beheaded. The Tie clan group shouts her name, but the text says it cannot bring her back to life. Narration later counts Tie Mu, Tie Xian Hua, and Tie Dao Ku among those who died in Fang Yuan’s hands in that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        362
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Months later Tie Ruo Nan faces tombstones that name Tie Mu, Tie Dao Ku, Tie Xian Hua, Tie Ao Kai, and Tie Ba Xiu. Tie Mu Bai tells her Tie clansmen are buried where they die, and names Tie Xian Hua among those for whom dying on the battlefield is the greatest honor.",
      "chapters": [
        369
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grave-markers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_ruo_nan",
        "char_tie_ao_kai",
        "char_tie_ba_xiu",
        "char_tie_mu_bai"
      ]
    }
  ],
